{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/improvement-notice-issued-to-oldham-metropolitan-borough-council-november-2023","content_id":"5cc1f1f0-9ea6-43a1-b394-b60a7c459a65","description":"An improvement notice issued to Oldham Metropolitan Borough Council following an Ofsted inspection in June 2023.","details":{"attachments":[{"accessible":true,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternative.formats@education.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"654e3b816a650f0012bf47f1","filename":"Improvement_notice_to_Oldham_Metropolitan_Borough_Council_-_November_2023.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":151913,"filename":"Improvement_notice_to_Oldham_Metropolitan_Borough_Council_-_November_2023.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9282301","isbn":"","number_of_pages":4,"title":"Improvement notice to Oldham Metropolitan Borough Council","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/654e3b816a650f0012bf47f1/Improvement_notice_to_Oldham_Metropolitan_Borough_Council_-_November_2023.pdf"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><div class=\"call-to-action\">\n  <p>This improvement notice was lifted on 15 April 2026 following a review of Oldham Council’s <abbr title=\"special educational needs and disabilities\">SEND</abbr> services.</p>\n</div>\n\n<p>This improvement notice requires Oldham Metropolitan Borough Council to take steps to improve its special educational needs and disabilities (<abbr title=\"special educational needs and disabilities\">SEND</abbr>) services.</p>\n\n<p>It follows an <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://reports.ofsted.gov.uk/provider/44/80535\">Ofsted and Care Quality Commission (<abbr title=\"Care Quality Commission\">CQC</abbr>) area <abbr title=\"special educational needs and disabilities\">SEND</abbr> inspection</a> that judged there were 2 areas for priority action.</p>\n\n</div>",